  "Choose your partner": "選擇你的夥伴",
  "The starters from every region, plus two more friends.": "各地區的最初夥伴，還有兩位熟悉的朋友。",
  "Choose": "選擇",
  "Choose another": "換一位夥伴",
  "Let's go together!": "一起出發！",
  "Your partner:": "你的夥伴：",
  "There's a fight in the middle of town! What do you do?": "城鎮裡有人打起來了！你會怎麼做？",
  "I jump in to help without thinking.": "立刻衝過去幫忙。",
  "I look for someone who can stop it.": "找能夠制止他們的人。",
  "I watch everything from afar.": "在遠處觀察情況。",
  "I laugh and cheer both of them on.": "笑著替雙方加油。",
  "You find a wallet on the ground.": "你在地上發現一個錢包。",
  "I take it to the police right away.": "馬上送到警察局。",
  "I look for its owner even if it takes hours.": "花再久都要找到失主。",
  "First I check what's inside…": "先看看裡面有什麼…",
  "I don't even touch it, just in case.": "以防萬一，完全不碰。",
  "You have an important exam tomorrow.": "明天有一場重要考試。",
  "I study until late at night.": "努力讀書到深夜。",
  "I review just enough: I trust myself.": "適度複習，相信自己的準備。",
  "I get really stressed.": "緊張得不得了。",
  "Exam? I'll see tomorrow.": "考試？明天再說吧。",
  "Someone mocks you in front of everyone.": "有人當著大家的面嘲笑你。",
  "I answer back on the spot.": "當場反駁。",
  "I hit back with a better joke.": "用更好笑的笑話回敬。",
  "I ignore them completely.": "完全不理會。",
  "It hurts, even if I don't say it.": "雖然沒說，但心裡受傷了。",
  "What matters most to you?": "對你來說，什麼最重要？",
  "Being the best.": "成為最強的人。",
  "Friendship.": "友情。",
  "Freedom.": "自由。",
  "Calm.": "平靜。",
  "The path splits: one dark and short, the other long and sunny.": "前方有兩條路：陰暗的捷徑，或明亮的遠路。",
  "The dark one, more excitement!": "走陰暗的，感覺更刺激！",
  "The long one, no rush.": "走遠路，慢慢來。",
  "I sit down to think it over.": "坐下來想清楚。",
  "Neither: I make a new shortcut.": "都不選，自己開一條捷徑。",
  "What do your friends say about you?": "朋友們會怎麼形容你？",
  "That they can always count on me.": "總是值得信賴。",
  "That I'm the funniest one in the group.": "團體裡最有趣的人。",
  "That I'm a bit mysterious.": "有一點神祕。",
  "That I never give up.": "從不輕易放棄。",
  "Your ideal day off is…": "理想的休假日是…",
  "Training to get better.": "鍛鍊自己，繼續進步。",
  "Hanging out with all my friends.": "和朋友們一起出去玩。",
  "An adventure with no plan at all.": "來一趟毫無計畫的冒險。",
  "Reading, thinking, being calm.": "閱讀、思考，享受安靜。",
  "You don't think twice when someone needs help.": "有人需要幫忙時，你從不猶豫。",
  "Your friends know they can always count on you.": "朋友們知道，你永遠值得信賴。",
  "You measure every step before taking it.": "每一步行動前，你都會仔細思考。",
  "You spread energy wherever you go.": "不管走到哪裡，你都充滿活力。",
  "You keep calm when things get complicated.": "情況越複雜，你越能保持冷靜。",
  "You act first and think later. Sometimes it works!": "你總是先行動再思考，有時意外地管用！",
  "You push yourself to be the best, and you almost always are.": "你努力追求最好，也經常做得到。",
  "You always have a joke ready.": "你總有一個笑話準備讓大家開心。",
  "You do your own thing and don't care.": "你自在地做自己，不在意別人的眼光。",
  "It's hard for you to take the first step, but you feel deeply.": "踏出第一步有點困難，但你的情感很細膩。",
  "Nothing fazes you. Nothing.": "沒有什麼能讓你慌張，真的沒有。",
  "You know how to wait for the right moment.": "你知道如何等待最好的時機。",
  "Not even you know what you'll do next.": "連你自己都不知道，下一步會做什麼。",
  "Giving up isn't in your plans.": "你的計畫裡沒有放棄這件事。",
  "You see solutions where others see problems.": "別人看到難題時，你看見了方法。",
  "Your kindness calms everyone around you.": "你的溫柔，能讓身邊的人安心。",
